SUMMARY:🦋 (Webinar) Design the Ruth Way
LOCATION:East Bay Venue\, Contra Costa
DESCRIPTION:Join Garden Manager Walker Young us for a webinar exploring the design principles Ruth Bancroft used to create her iconic dry garden. We’ll look at how Ruth balanced bold plant forms\, thoughtful spacing\, texture\, structure\, and a desert-inspired aesthetic\, while making practical choices around water\, soil\, and long-term plant health. Learn about how the horticultural team continues to carry out Ru https://www.ruthbancroftgarden.org/event/design-the-ruth-way/
