UID:freshoffpagenewmusicalth_2026-11-06@sproutscout.app
DTSTAMP:20260919T162516Z
DTSTART:20261106T040000Z
DTEND:20261106T053000Z
SUMMARY:📚 Fresh off the Page: New Musical Theater
LOCATION:Feinstein's at The Nikko\, San Francisco
DESCRIPTION:FRESH OFF THE PAGE THURSDAY NOVEMBER 5\, 2026 Step into the future of musical theatre with Fresh Off the Page\, an exciting evening of brand-new work from the next generation of groundbreaking theatre makers. This one-night-only showcase brings together bold new songs\, fresh stories\, and original voices that are pushing musical theatre in unexpected directions. Featuring work by Joshua Gilstein\, Maggie Grabmeier\, Nicole Jost\, Chris Steele\, Kat Robichaud\, and special guests\, the evening offers audiences a rare opportunity to experience new material while it's still fresh\, fearless\, and evolving. Whether you're a devoted musical-theatre fan\, a writer\, performer\, producer\, or simply someone who loves discovering what's next\, Fresh Off the Page puts you in the room at the beginning of something new. Come hear the songs before they reach their next stage\, meet the artists shaping tomorrow's theatre\, and experience the excitement of live musical storytelling as it develops right in front of you. Fresh Off the Page --- new voices\, new music\, and the next generation of musical theatre. Fresh off the Page is an exciting evening of new musical theatre written by the next generation of groundbreaking theater makers. Featuring the work of Joshua Gilstein\, Maggie Grabmeier\, Nicole Jost\, Chris Steele\, Kat Robichaud\, and special guests. https://www.ticketweb.com/event/fresh-off-the-page-new-feinsteins-at-the-nikko-tickets/14318384
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/fresh-off-the-page-new-feinsteins-at-the-nikko-tickets/14318384
END:VEVENT
